{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.webp?t=1758394742\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" class=\"bb_img\" width=459 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/a18ee7a09fd343570a49b97582ca96e1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Sapo Xul\u00e9 and Unwanted Marriage&quot; our hero uses his skills in \u201cKung-Foot Odor\u201d to defeat the Sapo King's army and the Henchmen's Syndicate, in order to prevent the forced marriage of his beloved with the ruler of Sap\u00f3polis .  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STINKY FEET INCLUDED, BE CAREFUL!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/6b43e8c89268a3f90b63663e40da2094.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about his low popularity, Sapo King, the mayor of Sap\u00f3polis (and self-styled King), discovers that the population longs for a first lady! To resolve the situation, he orders the snake Sibila to create a love potion to be used on the \u201ccandidate\u201d for marriage. The problem is the chosen one: Sapita, the most fragrant and beautiful frog in the city, and Sapo Xul\u00e9's \u201cgirlfriend\u201d. Upon learning, our hero sets out to rescue his beloved, but will encounter many challenges along the way, such as the Royal Guard and the Henchmen's Syndicate, who will do everything to stop him in time for the wedding to take place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/12555ba9e3f43345ff6c6045cfa284fb.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Sapo Xul\u00e9's iconic return to the world of games, in his first game fully developed for the character and his universe, taking advantage of elements from all the media in which he previously participated;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2D platform game with graphics handcrafted by the character's creator, artist Paulo Jos\u00e9;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Six levels/worlds with themed stages and boss battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In addition to the \u201cKung-Foot Odor\u201d attacks, the hero will have the help of the little fly Dorot\u00e9ia, which will help him collect items and increase his range when jumping and moving;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Shop for purchasing items and unlockables that go back to Sapo Xul\u00e9's 30-year history (Comics, Animated Series, V\u00eddeos, Etc.); </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original soundtrack created by musicians Leandro and Nelton Matioli;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original Game Engine created by Squash Studios;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Casual Mode (perfect for kids or for those who just want to enjoy the adventure without worrying about difficulty);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5b05818f2253df95aaf1a473f922ccd1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The 